title: 'statement-store: with the v2 DHT path on, steering alone edits the reserved set'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    With the v2 DHT path on, the statement set reserves only the peers that steering picks, every
    other peer holds an inbound slot and the protocol controller dials no peer of its own. Peer
    steering tracks the peers it holds in the reserved set and reserves every desired peer,
    including one that connected on its own. A peer on the v1 fallback protocol stays out of the
    orchestrator and is never reserved.
crates:
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: minor
